{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261102/photo/bkn-20261102131455732-1102_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261102144905\"/><p>啟德有男子遇電騙。今午(2日)12時55分，承豐道1331號青年旅舍一名18歲男子報案，指早前收到來電，對方自稱入境處職員，指其曾發出虛假訊息，需要轉帳款項以證清白，男子信以為真，轉帳共64萬元予對方指定戶口，騙徒得手後隨即失聯，事主始懷疑被騙，遂報案求助，案件列「詐騙」跟進。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T07:00:53.900240+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T05:14:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T13:38:21.736929+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T06:58:39.770952+00:00","content_hash":"49e1cca848f37ea14ce6b38b1aad391cca032373f42b81df5af6527505f06f69","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T07:00:53.900240+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}